WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

4
01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

5
01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 20=

6
01:39.740 --> 01:40.540
I want more!

7
01:41.050 --> 01:42.540
Just one more.

8
01:42.690 --> 01:44.260
- Is there more? - Is there more?

9
01:44.740 --> 01:45.490
I want that one!

10
01:46.130 --> 01:46.690
I didn't realize

11
01:47.490 --> 01:48.540
you liked children so much.

12
01:48.690 --> 01:49.980
This is delicious!

13
01:50.900 --> 01:51.430
No more.

14
01:51.480 --> 01:52.230
Still hungry?

15
01:52.290 --> 01:53.020
Yes.

16
01:53.850 --> 01:54.620
I don't like children.

17
01:56.380 --> 01:56.820
Your Highness,

18
01:57.460 --> 01:58.380
but just now...

19
01:58.490 --> 01:58.980
Yan Shang!

20
01:59.210 --> 02:00.100
I don't like children!

21
02:00.460 --> 02:01.180
Do I make myself clear?

22
02:06.620 --> 02:07.020
I'm sorry.

23
02:08.130 --> 02:09.030
Here, have one.

24
02:09.080 --> 02:10.030
Let me try!

25
02:10.260 --> 02:10.950
Let me try!

26
02:11.000 --> 02:11.910
- Here. - This one's mine!

27
02:12.060 --> 02:12.980
Try this one.

28
02:13.060 --> 02:13.610
I'm going back.

29
02:14.060 --> 02:15.130
Give me one.

30
02:15.780 --> 02:16.410
Look at this.

31
02:16.690 --> 02:17.500
I want more!

32
02:18.060 --> 02:19.500
I want another one.

33
02:19.690 --> 02:20.850
- Is there more? - Is there more?

34
02:20.940 --> 02:21.730
Aren't you going back?

35
02:21.780 --> 02:22.500
I want this one.

36
02:22.690 --> 02:23.420
Don't grab it!

37
02:23.470 --> 02:25.840
- It's mine! - I've only got one left!

38
02:26.340 --> 02:26.610
Right.

39
02:27.940 --> 02:29.220
Your Highness, go on without me.

40
02:29.850 --> 02:30.730
I still have things to do.

41
02:32.850 --> 02:33.380
Smells delicious!

42
02:33.500 --> 02:34.690
Here, give me one.

43
02:36.380 --> 02:37.130
Smells delicious!

44
02:37.540 --> 02:38.290
Smells delicious!

45
02:53.410 --> 02:54.780
Of course he'd mind.

46
03:01.260 --> 03:02.940
Who wouldn't?

47
03:08.570 --> 03:09.570
Even I...

48
03:34.010 --> 03:34.410
Your Highness!

49
03:37.340 --> 03:38.100
(Princess Danyang's Residence) Did you just get here?

50
03:38.570 --> 03:39.690
I thought you'd be home by now.

51
03:40.980 --> 03:41.450
What's wrong?

52
03:42.380 --> 03:43.130
Where have you been?

53
03:46.380 --> 03:47.100
They're all gone.

54
03:47.850 --> 03:48.890
You didn't save one for yourself.

55
03:49.410 --> 03:50.570
So I went to buy more.

56
03:51.130 --> 03:52.170
The shops were already closed.

57
03:52.660 --> 03:53.610
I knocked for ages.

58
03:59.010 --> 03:59.450
Aren't you cold?

59
04:00.060 --> 04:00.340
Come on.

60
04:01.060 --> 04:01.570
Get inside.

61
04:15.100 --> 04:15.890
Why are you so clumsy?

62
04:16.140 --> 04:17.250
Didn't you play with these as a child?

63
04:17.850 --> 04:18.340
No.

64
04:19.020 --> 04:19.670
When I was little,

65
04:19.720 --> 04:21.480
I spent every day studying and doing farm work.

66
04:22.140 --> 04:22.580
Unlike you,

67
04:23.460 --> 04:24.170
always so mischievous.

68
04:24.170 --> 04:27.820
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

69
04:29.120 --> 04:32.140
♪Be the sleeve we held♪

70
04:32.140 --> 04:32.490
Try it.

71
04:32.490 --> 04:35.720
♪Worn by dust and years♪

72
04:35.720 --> 04:37.250
♪Let's conspire♪

73
04:37.250 --> 04:37.700
Is it good?

74
04:37.700 --> 04:41.980
♪To grow old together♪

75
04:42.810 --> 04:43.140
Wipe your mouth.

76
04:44.260 --> 04:49.200
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

77
04:49.250 --> 04:49.730
You have some too.

78
04:49.900 --> 04:55.930
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - Let grief drown in your eyes♪

79
04:57.630 --> 05:00.614
♪Soar with the wind, burning bright as a song♪

80
05:00.615 --> 05:02.480
♪Plunge into hellfire as one♪

81
05:02.700 --> 05:05.850
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

82
05:06.580 --> 05:11.210
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

83
05:11.790 --> 05:15.890
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

84
05:16.580 --> 05:18.430
♪Not a single hour less♪

85
05:18.480 --> 05:25.480
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

86
05:26.140 --> 05:29.320
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

87
05:29.680 --> 05:33.000
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

88
05:33.000 --> 05:34.460
♪If we can stay♪

89
05:34.460 --> 05:34.810
Your Highness.

90
05:36.580 --> 05:37.100
What's wrong?

91
05:37.810 --> 05:39.250
I loved reading as a child.

92
05:40.290 --> 05:40.700
And now,

93
05:41.460 --> 05:42.250
I still do.

94
05:43.220 --> 05:44.250
What you loved as a child,

95
05:45.050 --> 05:45.490
you can

96
05:46.410 --> 05:47.580
still love as an adult.

97
05:47.580 --> 05:50.460
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain♪

98
05:50.460 --> 05:51.220
That's different.

99
05:52.140 --> 05:53.050
These little things

100
05:53.610 --> 05:55.050
are meant to be gifts

101
05:55.290 --> 05:56.340
that bring you joy.

102
05:57.220 --> 05:58.290
If you have to buy for yourself

103
05:58.610 --> 05:59.490
everything you want,

104
06:00.220 --> 06:00.980
how sad is that?

105
06:01.490 --> 06:02.050
That won't happen to me.

106
06:07.490 --> 06:07.980
Then

107
06:08.700 --> 06:09.660
I'll buy them for you.

108
06:11.140 --> 06:12.900
Whether you're ten

109
06:13.460 --> 06:13.850
or

110
06:14.610 --> 06:15.610
twenty.

111
06:17.380 --> 06:22.320
♪Let me be the fireflies dancing across your brow♪

112
06:25.610 --> 06:26.700
You spent next to nothing,

113
06:27.170 --> 06:28.100
and you're making me sad.

114
06:30.060 --> 06:33.466
♪Together we'll soar to the skies, burning bright as a song♪

115
06:33.467 --> 06:35.170
♪Together we'll turn to ashes♪

116
06:35.220 --> 06:36.210
Your embroidered shoes are wet.

117
06:36.260 --> 06:38.240
♪Two shadows entwined, a beautiful sight♪

118
06:38.240 --> 06:38.660
Your Highness,

119
06:40.580 --> 06:41.370
let me take you back to your room.

120
06:41.370 --> 06:45.010
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

121
06:45.010 --> 06:49.110
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

122
06:49.800 --> 06:51.650
♪Not a single hour less♪

123
06:51.700 --> 06:58.700
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

124
06:59.360 --> 07:02.540
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

125
07:02.900 --> 07:06.220
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

126
07:06.390 --> 07:12.990
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world, let's return to when we first met♪

127
07:13.720 --> 07:16.000
♪- May time be free of fear; - Boats rock♪

128
07:16.000 --> 07:18.030
♪- May time be free of pain; - Lights fade, seasons turn♪

129
07:18.080 --> 07:20.540
♪You're the only one I need♪

130
07:20.880 --> 07:27.870
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

131
07:28.020 --> 07:31.470
♪- Be my one and only in this world; - Be my one and only in this life♪

132
07:31.750 --> 07:34.490
♪My last untouched innocence♪

133
08:34.700 --> 08:35.420
May I?

134
08:36.820 --> 08:37.340
Your Highness.

135
08:38.850 --> 08:39.700
What did you call me?

136
08:48.220 --> 08:48.730
Wanyao.

137
09:22.940 --> 09:23.940
You're so clumsy.

138
09:24.300 --> 09:25.180
You can't do anything right.

139
09:25.370 --> 09:26.100
I have to teach you everything.

140
11:50.060 --> 11:50.490
Mr. Wang.

141
11:52.060 --> 11:52.340
Mr. Xu.

142
11:53.100 --> 11:54.220
What do you make

143
11:54.850 --> 11:55.770
of this passage?

144
11:58.490 --> 11:59.250
You mean

145
11:59.820 --> 12:00.250
this one?

146
12:05.340 --> 12:05.700
Mr. Xu,

147
12:07.010 --> 12:07.700
look at Mr. Yan.

148
12:08.650 --> 12:10.890
Early morning, not seriously proofreading,

149
12:11.460 --> 12:12.490
his face is all flushed.

150
12:13.580 --> 12:14.220
What do you think

151
12:15.100 --> 12:16.300
he's thinking about?

152
12:16.700 --> 12:17.580
I suppose...

153
12:18.530 --> 12:19.910
Look at that glowing face,

154
12:19.960 --> 12:21.270
so full of youthful vigor.

155
12:23.460 --> 12:24.370
Without the Princess,

156
12:24.940 --> 12:25.820
could a nobody like him

157
12:26.650 --> 12:27.820
have come third?

158
12:29.460 --> 12:30.460
Everyone has their own fate.

159
13:14.220 --> 13:15.580
Congratulations, Mr. Liu.

160
13:17.700 --> 13:18.180
After you.

161
13:27.530 --> 13:28.180
Stop staring.

162
13:28.890 --> 13:30.460
You're not destined for promotion.

163
13:30.700 --> 13:31.180
Wenji.

164
13:40.730 --> 13:41.340
Rice cake!

165
13:42.180 --> 13:42.490
Try some.

166
13:49.060 --> 13:49.490
I never thought

167
13:49.820 --> 13:51.130
I'd get to eat rice cake in Sheng'an.

168
13:54.580 --> 13:56.100
You should make a wish with a rice cake,

169
13:56.610 --> 13:57.460
just like we used to.

170
13:59.890 --> 14:00.650
Just like we used to!

171
14:01.820 --> 14:02.130
I wish

172
14:02.700 --> 14:03.420
my parents good health

173
14:03.820 --> 14:04.490
and peace throughout the land.

174
14:04.770 --> 14:05.100
And...

175
14:07.700 --> 14:08.420
may you reach the highest rank!

176
14:13.130 --> 14:13.650
May you

177
14:14.420 --> 14:15.220
rise to the very top.

178
14:18.130 --> 14:19.460
Is it authentic rice cake?

179
14:19.820 --> 14:20.340
I haven't tried it yet.

180
14:21.530 --> 14:21.890
Try some for yourself.

181
14:33.770 --> 14:34.850
- Not quite authentic. - Not quite authentic!

182
14:38.610 --> 14:39.530
I'll buy it from another shop next time.

183
14:51.100 --> 14:51.490
What's wrong?

184
15:06.650 --> 15:07.010
Yan Shang.

185
15:08.100 --> 15:10.130
I've been lucky to have you by my side

186
15:11.770 --> 15:12.650
after all I've been through.

187
15:17.700 --> 15:18.770
Back at the local school,

188
15:19.180 --> 15:20.220
how much did you help me?

189
15:20.940 --> 15:21.580
If I counted them all,

190
15:22.010 --> 15:22.890
I'd lose count.

191
15:25.130 --> 15:26.490
Just get to the point.

192
15:32.650 --> 15:32.940
Yan Shang.

193
15:34.250 --> 15:34.940
Actually...

194
15:37.220 --> 15:38.100
Yu Cheng'an talked to me.

195
15:54.180 --> 15:55.220
I nearly forgot all about you.

196
15:55.890 --> 15:57.340
You certainly know how to keep your cool.

197
15:57.820 --> 15:58.980
Always so quiet.

198
16:00.460 --> 16:00.940
I...

199
16:02.300 --> 16:03.250
dared not disturb you.

200
16:06.060 --> 16:07.650
I heard you used to study.

201
16:08.180 --> 16:09.340
Why become a eunuch?

202
16:10.130 --> 16:10.420
In reply

203
16:11.010 --> 16:11.730
to Lord Yu,

204
16:12.340 --> 16:12.730
I...

205
16:13.250 --> 16:15.340
once hoped to become an official,

206
16:16.370 --> 16:17.340
but fate had other plans.

207
16:18.100 --> 16:19.370
I met with misfortune.

208
16:23.770 --> 16:27.100
Scholars have always looked down on eunuchs.

209
16:27.530 --> 16:30.060
You must resent that.

210
16:33.820 --> 16:34.890
In reply to Lord Yu,

211
16:35.940 --> 16:36.530
I wouldn't dare.

212
16:40.300 --> 16:40.580
But...

213
16:42.610 --> 16:43.820
I do resent it.

214
16:49.610 --> 16:50.300
Tell me.

215
16:51.850 --> 16:52.770
Ten years of hard study,

216
16:54.580 --> 16:55.770
all to pass the exams

217
16:57.220 --> 16:58.530
and make a name for myself.

218
16:59.220 --> 16:59.650
But now,

219
17:01.530 --> 17:02.820
I failed.

220
17:08.700 --> 17:09.620
Then

221
17:10.900 --> 17:13.620
you should've stayed in the Imperial Cuisine Service,

222
17:14.330 --> 17:15.460
enjoying free food.

223
17:16.010 --> 17:17.620
You'd have got by just fine.

224
17:18.250 --> 17:20.460
Why go to Hongwen Hall,

225
17:20.510 --> 17:22.720
a place with no perks?

226
17:28.180 --> 17:30.530
Seems your ambition to climb higher

227
17:34.420 --> 17:35.660
is still alive and well.

228
17:38.860 --> 17:40.010
I wouldn't dare deceive you, Lord Yu.

229
17:41.810 --> 17:43.050
What I mean is,

230
17:45.010 --> 17:45.900
as a eunuch,

231
17:46.900 --> 17:47.290
must I

232
17:48.050 --> 17:49.620
spend my life serving tea,

233
17:50.140 --> 17:51.180
forever at others' beck and call?

234
17:51.860 --> 17:53.050
I've read some books

235
17:53.900 --> 17:54.860
and know a fair bit,

236
17:55.810 --> 17:57.220
so why shouldn't I aim higher?

237
17:58.700 --> 17:59.420
And Hongwen Hall

238
18:00.620 --> 18:02.420
offers better prospects than the Imperial Cuisine Service.

239
18:27.490 --> 18:27.980
Does he want

240
18:28.490 --> 18:29.010
to recruit you?

241
18:31.290 --> 18:31.570
No.

242
18:33.220 --> 18:33.730
Perhaps

243
18:35.140 --> 18:36.010
he just asked out of curiosity.

244
18:41.420 --> 18:41.700
Yan Shang,

245
18:43.810 --> 18:44.330
what do you think?

246
18:49.050 --> 18:49.660
Wenji,

247
18:51.050 --> 18:51.860
do you ever feel

248
18:52.660 --> 18:53.490
you could've done more?

249
19:01.220 --> 19:02.090
Princess Danyang

250
19:02.730 --> 19:03.770
helped me enter the Imperial Cuisine Service.

251
19:04.770 --> 19:05.530
And with your help,

252
19:06.860 --> 19:07.980
I got a post at Hongwen Hall.

253
19:09.620 --> 19:10.490
That fulfilled

254
19:12.220 --> 19:13.180
my dream as a scholar.

255
19:16.330 --> 19:17.620
I couldn't ask for more.

256
19:18.810 --> 19:19.700
But now,

257
19:20.810 --> 19:22.140
I've been thrown into endless hell,

258
19:23.140 --> 19:24.250
left broken and ruined.

259
19:25.900 --> 19:26.660
Some things,

260
19:29.490 --> 19:30.900
I understand far better

261
19:31.660 --> 19:32.250
than I used to.

262
19:34.860 --> 19:36.530
So many people study for ten years,

263
19:37.570 --> 19:38.420
only to seek

264
19:38.980 --> 19:40.010
enough food and warmth.

265
19:41.700 --> 19:42.490
Those who become eunuchs

266
19:43.620 --> 19:45.220
seek nothing more than a steady income.

267
19:48.140 --> 19:49.730
Shouldn't we aim higher,

268
19:50.420 --> 19:52.220
all the way to the heart of the Imperial Palace?

269
19:54.490 --> 19:55.220
Wenji,

270
19:55.980 --> 19:56.980
that's a dangerous path.

271
20:05.490 --> 20:06.090
Especially since

272
20:06.660 --> 20:08.220
Yu Cheng'an harmed Chunhua.

273
20:09.620 --> 20:10.380
Thanks for the warning.

274
20:12.770 --> 20:13.810
I haven't forgotten it.

275
20:16.730 --> 20:17.380
But Yan Shang,

276
20:18.460 --> 20:19.490
ever since you came to Sheng'an,

277
20:20.810 --> 20:21.810
entered the Princess's residence,

278
20:22.660 --> 20:23.660
and visited the Investigation Office,

279
20:24.730 --> 20:26.250
which path you've taken hasn't been dangerous?

280
20:27.660 --> 20:29.330
I'm only looking for a way to rise.

281
20:30.220 --> 20:30.870
I'm not about

282
20:30.920 --> 20:32.310
to risk my life for Yu Cheng'an.

283
20:35.460 --> 20:36.290
But I'm worried about you.

284
20:45.660 --> 20:45.980
Thank you.

285
20:56.570 --> 20:57.140
Wenji.

286
20:59.010 --> 20:59.730
I should thank you

287
21:01.490 --> 21:02.860
for speaking so frankly with me.

288
21:10.010 --> 21:10.660
It's getting late.

289
21:12.090 --> 21:12.460
Yan Shang,

290
21:13.570 --> 21:14.380
let me see you out of the palace.

291
21:22.940 --> 21:24.330
Tell me what you really think.

292
21:25.090 --> 21:25.700
I wouldn't mind

293
21:26.420 --> 21:27.420
if you laughed at my sincere words.

294
21:30.010 --> 21:30.530
I think,

295
21:32.010 --> 21:33.010
in ancient times,

296
21:33.250 --> 21:35.090
there was the Grand Historian.

297
21:35.730 --> 21:36.290
And today,

298
21:37.980 --> 21:38.770
there's Lord Yu,

299
21:39.460 --> 21:40.530
head of the eunuchs

300
21:41.180 --> 21:43.620
and a pillar of the Huai Dynasty.

301
22:04.530 --> 22:05.250
With Lord Yu as my example,

302
22:05.810 --> 22:06.530
I believe

303
22:06.770 --> 22:07.900
whether eunuch or court official,

304
22:08.250 --> 22:09.860
what matters is making a name in history.

305
22:10.620 --> 22:11.700
To rise through the ranks,

306
22:12.090 --> 22:13.420
the imperial exams aren't the only path.

307
22:14.180 --> 22:15.290
Can't a eunuch have

308
22:15.730 --> 22:16.620
a future of his own?

309
22:20.660 --> 22:21.290
Indeed.

310
22:22.220 --> 22:23.220
A fortune can't compare

311
22:23.860 --> 22:24.900
to the wisdom in books.

312
22:31.980 --> 22:34.660
If my foolish son could be like you,

313
22:35.770 --> 22:37.860
speaking such wisdom on the spot,

314
22:38.900 --> 22:40.090
I'd have nothing to worry about.

315
22:41.570 --> 22:42.220
You flatter me.

316
22:44.010 --> 22:44.730
Wenji.

317
22:46.940 --> 22:47.570
As for me,

318
22:48.490 --> 22:50.290
I've trained eunuchs before.

319
22:50.730 --> 22:52.290
They're loyal enough.

320
22:53.140 --> 22:53.900
However,

321
22:54.570 --> 22:56.900
they've read too little

322
22:57.980 --> 22:58.900
and lack the knowledge.

323
22:59.570 --> 23:00.420
They're not fit for great things.

324
23:02.660 --> 23:04.490
I'm willing to learn from you

325
23:05.420 --> 23:06.180
and I'll do my utmost

326
23:06.570 --> 23:07.620
to serve you faithfully!

327
23:13.730 --> 23:14.290
You may go.

328
23:20.900 --> 23:21.290
I will

329
23:23.380 --> 23:23.770
take my leave.

330
23:42.460 --> 23:43.530
(Since coming to Sheng'an,)

331
23:45.290 --> 23:46.290
(I've suffered one setback after another,)

332
23:47.570 --> 23:49.050
(fallen into a bottomless abyss.)

333
23:51.420 --> 23:53.380
(At last, there's a glimmer of hope.)

334
23:56.050 --> 23:56.380
(Yan Shang,)

335
23:57.620 --> 23:59.220
(how could I let this chance slip away?)

336
24:01.220 --> 24:02.010
(You told me,)

337
24:03.220 --> 24:04.770
(even without hope,)

338
24:05.570 --> 24:07.330
(I must live for what I believe in.)

339
24:08.090 --> 24:09.900
(Taking down a petty man like Zhang Jun)

340
24:10.620 --> 24:13.350
(took the Princess and the third-ranked scholar)

341
24:13.400 --> 24:14.350
(working so hard together.)

342
24:16.570 --> 24:17.530
(But my enemies)

343
24:19.050 --> 24:21.250
(are far more powerful than Zhang Jun.)

344
24:24.220 --> 24:25.010
(Power)

345
24:26.330 --> 24:28.380
(counts for nothing)

346
24:30.010 --> 24:31.330
(except)

347
24:32.700 --> 24:33.660
(before greater power.)

348
24:38.980 --> 24:39.900
(Within these palace walls,)

349
24:41.570 --> 24:43.770
(who knows if there's no path for me)

350
24:45.730 --> 24:47.140
(to reach the very top?)

351
24:58.860 --> 24:59.290
Your Highness,

352
24:59.700 --> 25:01.420
will you wear this pearl hairpin again today?

353
25:02.220 --> 25:03.250
I'll do your hair now.

354
25:08.290 --> 25:08.700
Cailian.

355
25:09.570 --> 25:10.420
Pick any outfit of mine.

356
25:10.860 --> 25:12.220
I'm giving it to you.

357
25:13.290 --> 25:14.460
Lend me

358
25:14.770 --> 25:15.290
what you're wearing.

359
25:15.740 --> 25:16.980
(Cailian, Princess Danyang's Maid)

360
25:23.220 --> 25:24.420
(Hongwen Hall; Pursuit of Wisdom) See you tomorrow, Mr. Wang.

361
25:24.660 --> 25:25.500
All right. See you tomorrow.

362
25:25.550 --> 25:26.030
Take care.

363
25:26.080 --> 25:26.450
I'm off.

364
25:27.810 --> 25:28.860
(Quiet Contemplation) Remember to proofread this.

365
25:33.220 --> 25:33.730
Yan Shang,

366
25:34.220 --> 25:35.220
why aren't you heading home?

367
25:35.330 --> 25:36.620
Your maid is waiting outside.

368
25:37.570 --> 25:38.290
A maid?

369
25:38.770 --> 25:39.330
Mine?

370
25:39.570 --> 25:40.940
Yes, that's what she said.

371
25:41.050 --> 25:41.730
She's here to pick you up.

372
25:50.460 --> 25:50.940
Yan Shang,

373
25:51.730 --> 25:53.330
your maid is absolutely stunning.

374
26:01.010 --> 26:01.620
She certainly is.

375
26:02.180 --> 26:03.390
I couldn't find a woman like her

376
26:03.440 --> 26:04.550
in my household.

377
26:05.620 --> 26:06.090
Yan Shang,

378
26:06.620 --> 26:07.980
would you be willing

379
26:08.420 --> 26:08.860
to part with her?

380
26:11.140 --> 26:12.620
Yan Shang, you should let her go.

381
26:13.010 --> 26:15.530
If you're willing to give her to me,

382
26:16.050 --> 26:16.730
you can name

383
26:17.140 --> 26:18.090
your price.

384
26:19.620 --> 26:20.730
This is no joking matter.

385
26:26.180 --> 26:27.700
Your Highness, what brings you here?

386
26:36.940 --> 26:38.090
Is a maid just an object

387
26:38.810 --> 26:39.620
for you to take?

388
26:40.660 --> 26:42.140
You petty officials

389
26:42.490 --> 26:43.380
dare to ask for me?

390
26:44.530 --> 26:44.940
What,

391
26:45.940 --> 26:47.090
have you grown tired of your wives?

392
26:48.290 --> 26:49.420
Now you want to marry a princess?

393
26:50.380 --> 26:51.090
I failed to welcome you

394
26:51.460 --> 26:52.290
and kept you waiting, Your Highness.

395
26:53.140 --> 26:53.860
I deserve death.

396
26:55.220 --> 26:55.890
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

397
26:55.940 --> 26:56.730
Your Highness, please forgive me.

398
27:06.380 --> 27:07.140
Calm down.

399
27:07.290 --> 27:08.010
Dear Yan Shang,

400
27:08.530 --> 27:09.900
aren't you happy to see me here?

401
27:10.530 --> 27:11.860
Wanyao, stop fooling around.

402
27:16.090 --> 27:16.460
Your Highness,

403
27:17.090 --> 27:18.620
it's dangerous to travel incognito.

404
27:19.530 --> 27:20.420
Let's go back.

405
27:20.860 --> 27:21.700
Free time's rare.

406
27:21.810 --> 27:22.900
That's why I dressed this way.

407
27:24.980 --> 27:25.940
I'm so glad

408
27:26.290 --> 27:27.010
you came to get me.

409
27:28.660 --> 27:29.290
So where shall we go?

410
27:30.010 --> 27:30.940
During the Double Festival,

411
27:31.250 --> 27:32.620
the Emperor lifts the curfew.

412
27:33.290 --> 27:34.050
I want to see the night market.

413
27:35.420 --> 27:36.490
Your Highness, but...

414
27:37.730 --> 27:39.330
The Princess has an order. Yan Shang, you must obey.

415
27:41.900 --> 27:42.220
All right.

416
27:43.330 --> 27:44.420
The Princess wishes to visit the night market.

417
27:44.860 --> 27:46.050
Yan Shang of Hongwen Hall will escort her.

418
27:46.420 --> 27:47.010
No disobedience.

419
27:48.140 --> 27:48.730
I obey.

420
27:49.490 --> 27:49.940
And one more thing,

421
27:50.570 --> 27:51.010
tonight,

422
27:51.330 --> 27:52.250
don't call me "Your Highness".

423
27:53.570 --> 27:54.490
I obey.

424
27:55.570 --> 27:55.860
Let's go.

425
27:59.940 --> 28:01.660
Look! The fire-breather is amazing!

426
28:01.730 --> 28:02.220
Look!

427
28:08.480 --> 28:10.200
(Leming Tavern)

428
28:13.220 --> 28:13.660
(Jinxiu Silk House)

429
28:19.250 --> 28:19.570
How is it?

430
28:21.380 --> 28:22.050
Too big.

431
28:24.420 --> 28:24.770
This one!

432
28:32.810 --> 28:33.570
You look better without it.

433
28:34.570 --> 28:35.180
Let's check the others.

434
28:41.050 --> 28:41.860
So pretty!

435
28:45.380 --> 28:46.050
No, thanks.

436
29:00.010 --> 29:00.660
Let's look over there.

437
29:15.810 --> 29:16.420
What's this?

438
29:18.620 --> 29:19.220
No idea.

439
29:19.900 --> 29:20.380
No idea?

440
29:21.420 --> 29:23.330
I'm from Lingnan. Of course I don't know.

441
29:23.660 --> 29:25.220
Then how come you, a local, don't know?

442
29:26.460 --> 29:28.530
I seldom hang out. How would I know?

443
29:29.140 --> 29:30.010
You country bumpkin!

444
29:30.980 --> 29:31.620
You don't even know this?

445
29:32.290 --> 29:33.330
Seldom hang out, huh?

446
29:36.540 --> 29:37.340
(Rose Pastry)

447
29:40.570 --> 29:40.940
Wanyao!

448
29:41.530 --> 29:42.900
I checked it. It's called rose pastry.

449
29:46.860 --> 29:47.330
Pretty?

450
29:50.330 --> 29:51.810
My colleagues didn't flatter you.

451
29:52.460 --> 29:53.050
My lady

452
29:53.730 --> 29:54.620
really is breathtaking.

453
29:58.180 --> 29:58.900
(Pretty!)

454
30:00.010 --> 30:01.180
What a flatterer,

455
30:02.700 --> 30:03.530
dear Yan Shang.

456
30:05.770 --> 30:06.290
Bravo!

457
30:06.660 --> 30:07.090
Bravo!

458
30:07.460 --> 30:08.290
So pretty!

459
30:09.090 --> 30:09.660
Yeah.

460
30:26.980 --> 30:27.530
Missed.

461
30:28.180 --> 30:28.660
Excuse me.

462
30:29.620 --> 30:30.010
Excuse me.

463
30:31.490 --> 30:31.740
Thanks.

464
30:31.790 --> 30:32.160
What good luck!

465
30:32.210 --> 30:32.690
Excuse me.

466
30:34.660 --> 30:34.950
Sir...

467
30:35.000 --> 30:35.640
Let's have a go too.

468
30:36.180 --> 30:36.460
All right.

469
30:37.770 --> 30:38.220
Sir,

470
30:38.530 --> 30:39.700
what's the first prize?

471
30:40.380 --> 30:40.860
That one.

472
30:44.770 --> 30:45.660
That's beautiful.

473
30:46.180 --> 30:46.570
I want it.

474
30:47.250 --> 30:48.090
Win one for me.

475
30:48.250 --> 30:48.570
Me?

476
30:49.570 --> 30:49.900
I...

477
30:50.860 --> 30:52.140
I can't.

478
30:54.220 --> 30:54.620
All right.

479
30:57.700 --> 30:58.290
Here, sir.

480
30:59.810 --> 31:00.660
Sir, the arrows are over there.

481
31:03.530 --> 31:03.900
Try that one.

482
31:12.940 --> 31:13.770
So close!

483
31:14.050 --> 31:14.570
Try again.

484
31:20.490 --> 31:21.530
Almost!

485
31:21.900 --> 31:23.740
See? One more won't help.

486
31:23.790 --> 31:24.380
One more!

487
31:24.430 --> 31:24.950
Let me try again.

488
31:25.620 --> 31:26.140
He'll make it this time.

489
31:26.220 --> 31:26.980
No chance.

490
31:29.220 --> 31:29.770
Let me show you.

491
31:47.530 --> 31:47.860
Again.

492
32:12.090 --> 32:13.090
My lady is amazing!

493
32:13.380 --> 32:13.770
One more time.

494
32:33.180 --> 32:34.090
Just one left.

495
32:34.490 --> 32:35.010
Try it yourself.

496
32:35.980 --> 32:37.460
Win or lose,

497
32:38.180 --> 32:39.140
the prize is ours.

498
32:41.140 --> 32:41.460
All right.

499
33:03.330 --> 33:04.250
How did it fall?

500
33:05.940 --> 33:07.020
It was fine a moment ago.

501
33:07.070 --> 33:07.790
The flower fell off.

502
33:13.180 --> 33:13.490
Sir?

503
33:14.140 --> 33:15.700
Why get rough, sir?

504
33:21.540 --> 33:23.580
(Meng Zaishi, Military Governor of the Central Circuit, North Jing)

505
33:39.460 --> 33:40.250
I don't want the prize.

506
33:41.250 --> 33:42.530
Give it to that lady.

507
33:43.810 --> 33:44.460
Yes, sir.

508
33:47.050 --> 33:47.420
No need.

509
33:48.770 --> 33:49.090
My lady,

510
33:49.530 --> 33:50.050
let's go home.

511
33:53.010 --> 33:53.730
Ladies and gentlemen...

512
33:54.090 --> 33:55.090
Your Highness, it's been a while.

513
34:01.140 --> 34:02.530
What do you want?

514
34:06.220 --> 34:08.130
So, you found yourself a new lover?

515
34:09.490 --> 34:09.940
Let's go.

516
34:10.340 --> 34:10.820
What's the hurry?

517
34:12.940 --> 34:14.260
Don't you want your things back?

518
34:28.690 --> 34:29.820
You've got the wrong person.

519
34:30.610 --> 34:31.460
This is my wife,

520
34:31.940 --> 34:32.820
not some princess.

521
34:33.420 --> 34:34.210
There's no curfew tonight.

522
34:34.860 --> 34:36.610
The Imperial Guards are everywhere.

523
34:37.010 --> 34:37.980
Please, show some restraint.

524
34:38.340 --> 34:39.380
Don't cause a scene with the officials

525
34:40.010 --> 34:40.980
and spoil the festivities.

526
34:46.130 --> 34:46.460
Dear,

527
34:47.260 --> 34:47.820
let's go home.

528
34:51.420 --> 34:51.820
Don't look back.

529
35:15.300 --> 35:15.690
Your Highness,

530
35:16.650 --> 35:17.050
are you all right?

531
35:18.610 --> 35:19.170
That man...

532
35:20.690 --> 35:21.340
He didn't follow us.

533
35:23.210 --> 35:24.130
Who was he?

534
35:24.980 --> 35:26.740
He didn't seem to be a local.

535
35:28.170 --> 35:29.090
As you said,

536
35:30.570 --> 35:31.490
he mistook me for someone else.

537
35:34.980 --> 35:35.380
Yan Shang,

538
35:36.300 --> 35:37.050
I'm a little tired.

539
35:38.130 --> 35:39.210
Take me back to the residence.

540
35:59.460 --> 36:00.490
You can go rest now.

541
36:00.860 --> 36:01.570
Everything's fine here.

542
36:03.010 --> 36:03.420
Got it.

543
36:28.610 --> 36:30.130
Mother, I hit it!

544
36:31.490 --> 36:31.980
Mother,

545
36:32.300 --> 36:34.050
(Young Mu Wanyao) let's see who can shoot more accurately.

546
36:35.130 --> 36:37.860
The other day, Yang Si challenged you to archery.

547
36:38.570 --> 36:39.820
Why didn't you accept?

548
36:41.170 --> 36:42.980
Mother, I don't want to compete with him.

549
36:43.490 --> 36:44.380
He cheats all the time.

550
36:44.900 --> 36:45.420
Mother,

551
36:45.860 --> 36:48.210
everyone gets a prize for competing.

552
36:48.780 --> 36:49.530
If I win,

553
36:49.780 --> 36:51.420
you should give me one too.

554
36:52.300 --> 36:54.340
So, what do you want?

555
36:56.530 --> 36:57.490
If I win,

556
36:57.980 --> 36:59.340
I want a hairpin.

557
36:59.940 --> 37:00.780
All right.

558
37:15.760 --> 37:18.650
(Rebellion of the Seven Military Governors)

559
37:18.650 --> 37:19.130
Mother,

560
37:19.650 --> 37:20.740
where are we going?

561
37:21.170 --> 37:22.210
I don't know either.

562
37:23.820 --> 37:26.090
Mother, can we still go home?

563
37:26.490 --> 37:27.650
I don't want to leave Sheng'an.

564
37:28.780 --> 37:29.690
Of course we can.

565
37:30.460 --> 37:31.420
Once the rebels are defeated,

566
37:31.740 --> 37:32.690
we can go home.

567
37:46.740 --> 37:47.170
Your Majesty!

568
37:47.490 --> 37:49.170
Your Majesty, urgent news!

569
37:49.820 --> 37:51.570
Your Majesty, good news!

570
37:51.980 --> 37:52.460
Your Majesty!

571
37:52.980 --> 37:54.570
The rebels in Jiannan Circuit have been defeated.

572
37:54.940 --> 37:57.570
Our forces captured rebel leader Jia Xingzhang

573
37:58.050 --> 37:59.230
and executed him on the spot!

574
37:59.280 --> 38:00.000
Who led the troops?

575
38:00.490 --> 38:02.420
It was Yu Cheng'an!

576
38:02.490 --> 38:03.050
Good!

577
38:12.820 --> 38:14.570
Yu Cheng'an, senior palace attendant,

578
38:15.050 --> 38:16.490
rose to the occasion in a crisis...

579
38:18.080 --> 38:19.600
(Sheng'an)

580
38:31.740 --> 38:32.210
Mother.

581
38:33.490 --> 38:34.340
Apart from North Jing,

582
38:34.530 --> 38:36.130
are all the rebellions put down?

583
38:36.780 --> 38:37.260
Almost.

584
38:38.210 --> 38:39.610
We'll be back in Sheng'an soon.

585
38:41.580 --> 38:44.020
(Sheng'an)

586
38:56.610 --> 38:59.540
Meng Baiyu, Military Commander of North Jing's Central Circuit,

587
38:59.590 --> 39:01.030
has shown great virtue and loyalty.

588
39:01.340 --> 39:02.650
We greatly commend him.

589
39:03.210 --> 39:05.260
Our eldest daughter, Princess Danyang,

590
39:05.610 --> 39:07.010
is gentle and virtuous,

591
39:07.490 --> 39:08.940
well-versed in propriety.

592
39:09.490 --> 39:10.300
We hereby decree

593
39:10.490 --> 39:11.820
that she be wed to Meng.

594
39:12.260 --> 39:13.490
Proclaim this far and wide.

595
39:13.980 --> 39:15.860
See that it is carried out.

596
39:17.780 --> 39:18.740
I beg you, Lord Yu.

597
39:21.340 --> 39:21.860
Your Highness

598
39:22.420 --> 39:23.650
has the support of the whole realm.

599
39:24.820 --> 39:27.430
Now war ravages the land,

600
39:27.480 --> 39:28.590
and the people are suffering.

601
39:29.490 --> 39:31.860
And Your Highness wants to stand aside?

602
39:32.740 --> 39:33.340
In times like these,

603
39:33.780 --> 39:35.130
how could that be acceptable?

604
40:00.860 --> 40:02.940
♪A daughter ventures forth♪

605
40:03.550 --> 40:05.990
♪In the name her father gave♪

606
40:06.950 --> 40:12.820
♪Into savage lands, to tame tigers and slay wolves♪

607
40:13.650 --> 40:14.210
What are you doing?

608
40:14.980 --> 40:20.380
♪The fate is sealed, a destiny bestowed by Heaven♪

609
40:21.410 --> 40:27.740
♪When did you decide to defy it, to change it?♪

610
40:29.140 --> 40:31.120
(Mingde Gate)

611
40:31.120 --> 40:36.010
♪Defy its might, and the submission it demands♪

612
40:36.540 --> 40:42.180
♪Defy its scorn, stain the sky with blood♪

613
40:44.600 --> 40:48.560
♪We weren't born for sacrifice. Love isn't meant for silent suffering♪

614
40:48.560 --> 40:51.000
♪Nor wed for the sake of any kingdom♪ (Central Circuit; North Jing)

615
40:51.000 --> 40:52.940
♪Cold as a blade, yet peerless as a bloom♪

616
40:52.940 --> 40:54.090
The soldiers are charging!

617
40:54.990 --> 40:58.060
♪Who dares make me bow down in the dust?♪

618
42:08.490 --> 42:09.170
Let me go!

619
42:20.460 --> 42:21.340
Put me down!

620
42:22.090 --> 42:22.940
By Central Circuit custom,

621
42:23.420 --> 42:24.650
the bride is seized.

622
42:25.210 --> 42:26.170
Don't you know?

623
42:26.610 --> 42:27.490
I'm from Sheng'an!

624
42:29.260 --> 42:30.300
Not for much longer!

625
42:33.340 --> 42:33.940
Your Highness!

626
42:42.610 --> 42:43.340
My hairpin!

627
43:11.680 --> 43:15.920
(With Bold, Majestic Strides)

628
43:49.980 --> 43:51.940
(So this is my husband-to-be?)

629
43:58.200 --> 44:00.600
(Meng Baiyu, Military Governor of the Central Circuit, North Jing)

630
44:13.090 --> 44:15.300
You're not too pampered to come after all.

631
44:15.650 --> 44:16.650
You are right.

632
44:18.530 --> 44:20.090
But married or not,

633
44:21.170 --> 44:22.050
wherever I go,

634
44:23.690 --> 44:24.940
I'm still a princess of Huai.

635
44:25.820 --> 44:26.940
Then today,

636
44:27.980 --> 44:29.860
it's time for the Princess of Huai

637
44:31.340 --> 44:32.740
to serve me in the bridal chamber.

638
44:37.980 --> 44:38.860
I'm from the Central Plains.

639
44:39.610 --> 44:40.380
By our custom,

640
44:40.820 --> 44:41.570
we haven't shared the wedding feast,

641
44:42.090 --> 44:42.650
drunk the nuptial wine,

642
44:43.380 --> 44:44.300
bowed to each other,

643
44:44.570 --> 44:45.170
or greeted our guests.

644
44:46.300 --> 44:47.300
How can we retire to the bridal chamber?

645
45:22.100 --> 45:26.500
(Next Episode Preview)

646
45:27.010 --> 45:28.900
We have to make it out alive.

647
45:31.170 --> 45:32.460
So is your father!

648
45:32.510 --> 45:34.280
And Yu Cheng'an's the biggest liar of all!

649
45:35.490 --> 45:38.170
I'd never have spared your worthless life!

650
45:43.320 --> 45:46.613
♪Be the ferry where you wait for the sun♪

651
45:49.298 --> 45:54.214
♪Be the blue silk that catches your tears♪

652
45:56.408 --> 46:02.253
♪Be the sleeve we held, worn by dust and years♪

653
46:02.753 --> 46:07.979
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

654
46:10.748 --> 46:15.539
♪Let me be a captive beast bound by the same lock as you♪

655
46:16.375 --> 46:22.454
♪- Through trails of mud and blood; - let grief drown in your eyes♪

656
46:24.255 --> 46:27.405
♪Soar with the wind; plunge into hellfire as one♪

657
46:27.405 --> 46:29.053
♪Burning bright as a song♪

658
46:29.105 --> 46:32.829
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

659
46:33.207 --> 46:37.873
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

660
46:38.492 --> 46:42.533
♪If we say forever, then forever it shall be♪

661
46:43.024 --> 46:45.139
♪Not a single hour less♪

662
46:45.179 --> 46:52.125
♪However deep the snow, I'll wait if you're there♪

663
46:52.888 --> 46:56.341
♪We'll be gods above, or wandering souls♪

664
46:56.521 --> 46:59.666
♪In heaven or the underworld, you're all I need♪

665
47:00.105 --> 47:06.742
♪If we can stay, let's return to the village of our first meeting♪

666
47:07.139 --> 47:09.177
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

667
47:09.177 --> 47:11.653
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

668
47:11.691 --> 47:14.160
♪You're the only one I need♪

669
47:14.364 --> 47:21.251
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain, nothing can break us♪

670
47:21.563 --> 47:24.834
♪Be mine in this world; be mine in this life♪

671
47:25.139 --> 47:28.312
♪My last untouched innocence♪

672
47:28.636 --> 47:32.062
♪If only we could return to the village where we first met♪

673
47:32.295 --> 47:35.520
♪Stay by me; help me forget the frozen dream of last night♪

674
47:35.851 --> 47:42.647
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips; just us, through dawn and dusk♪

675
47:43.016 --> 47:45.078
♪- May time be free of fear; - boats rock♪

676
47:45.079 --> 47:47.582
♪- May time be free of pain; - lights fade, seasons turn♪

677
47:47.629 --> 47:49.967
♪You're the only one I need♪

678
47:50.198 --> 47:57.033
♪By your side, through joy and pain, is that eternity?♪

679
47:57.382 --> 47:59.000
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

680
47:59.130 --> 48:00.926
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

681
48:01.283 --> 48:04.300
♪You're the only one I need♪

682
48:04.340 --> 48:05.667
(No animals were harmed or mistreated in production.)

